! mcp_bootstrap_p248.strap -- MCP printed page 248: the Input Program's
! card-reader recovery section (R CSAV .. R CSETP), lines 1-51.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_001-249.pdf PDF p.255, read at 400 dpi, 900 dpi for
! doubtful glyphs.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 11D11MCP
! CARD ID CB000238  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 248" (the card ID
! prints "CBC00238": a round glyph in a numeric field, 0); the heading
! row's LOCATION field is 230021, line 1's word.
!
! THE PAGE.  51 lines, all located, contiguous from 230021.40 to
! 230054.00 (a half word; next location 230054.40), then blank paper.
! p.247 ends with a full word at 230020.40 (BZB,2.12($13),RCENT1), so
! line 1's .40 continues it; p.249 opens at 230054.40.  No remarks.
! Asterisks after the LOCATION on lines 1, 23, 44.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * line 21 "RCCUNT" = RCOUNT (worn O): lines 8, 23, 30 print RCOUNT
!     with the O closed; LC prints 230166.74, the same word.
!   * line 35 "REJJCB" = REJJOB (worn O): C22-6728 names REJJOB (bits
!     60/61, "set by the input program"); BB1 h1 230364.76 = REJJOB.62.
!   * line 38 "RCUTCN" = RCUTDN: the defining card, p.249 line 21 at
!     230066.40, prints the fifth glyph with a straight left stem (D) at
!     900 dpi, and p.249 line 8 BXE,RCUTDN likewise.  BAE prints
!     230066.76 = that location.  (Vision reads RCUTDN on p.249.)
!   * line 28 "VPC" = VPD: landed decks (p.214/215/221) spell VPD at
!     225427.0; LX prints 225427.02.
!   * line 40 RCETJM: p.249 line 17 defines RCETJM at 230064.40 (the M
!     prints with a worn right leg, Vision RCETJN); BXCZ 230064.70.
!   * line 18 "M-1": the glyph is the digit 1 (flagged top), M-1 the
!     subtract-one sibling of p.197's M+1.
!   * line 18's last byte prints "BC" and is B0: its low nibble is the
!     offset's index (I2), and M-1,RCJAM prints no second operand --
!     the same "BC" for B0 that landed p.221 line 38 settled.  RCJAM's
!     (B,25,1) is read off the same half word, 031100.12: length 25,
!     byte size 1, signed (bit 51 clear; M+1/M-1 on a (BU) field print
!     .22/.32), the form landed decks give VTSQ for M+1's 031100.02.
!   * line 12's last byte prints "DC"; lines 46 and 48 (same statement
!     form, SVA,$14,RCREXT+n.32) print D0, and an open round in a hex
!     field is 0 (brief): written D0.
!   * line 51's byte prints "C0" (C+I; line 7's C+I prints 00) and is
!     00; octal fields printing "CCCC17.33" etc. are 0.  Lines 4 and 38
!     print C2 (BXE, BAE), which those statements assemble to.
!
! CARD SERIALS.  Right-hand serials run 0B000238 .. 0B000268 (prefix
! glyph round, as in the header).  Shared serials: 1-2 (238), 3-4
! (239), 5-6 (240), 7-8 (241), 11-12 (244), 13-16 (245, four lines),
! 21-22 (250), 25-26 (253), 28-30 (255), 31-32 (256), 33-34 (257),
! 39-40 (262), 41-43 (263), 45-46 (265), 47-48 (266), 50-51 (268).  No
! serial is skipped on the page; p.249 opens at 0B000270 (no 269
! printed on either page).

